+- The field-churn normalization candidate was quickly dispatched by a single DB probe (gain vs field_std correlation ≈ -0.12 for VER 2023), showing normalization would add noise not signal.
+
+**Improvement signals:**
+- Commander skill could note: for investigation-only deliverables with no src/ changes, skip the crew dispatch and drive the work directly — just log the deviation at feedback. The current skill says 'within a step, judgment is yours' which covers it, but making it explicit would reduce friction.
+- The main `f1_data.db` file being empty (0 rows in all tables) while all data lives in per-year DBs is a footgun for new investigations. Consider noting this in the ORCHESTRATOR_CONTEXT or agent launch orders as a data-location invariant.
